   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.001</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>GET /entitlements/packages</p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">List of packages and their features</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl hide-border-bottom" style=
=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
        <b class=3D"code-title">Response Payload</b><span class=3D"collapse=
-source expand-control" style=3D"display:none;"><span class=3D"expand-contr=
ol-icon icon">&nbsp;</span><span class=3D"expand-control-text">Expand sourc=
e</span></span><span class=3D"collapse-spinner-wrapper"></span>
       </div>
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl hide-toolbar">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: json; gutter: true; collapse: true">{
=09"packages": [{
=09=09"id": "",
=09=09"name": "",
=09=09"description": "",
=09=09"group": "",
=09=09"active": boolean,
=09=09"features": [{
=09=09=09"resource": "",
=09=09=09"mandatory": boolean,
=09=09=09"selected": boolean
=09=09}]
=09}]
}</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><br></p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.002</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>GET /entitlements/resources</p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">List of resources</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl hide-border-bottom" style=
=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
        <b class=3D"code-title">Response Payload</b><span class=3D"collapse=
-source expand-control" style=3D"display:none;"><span class=3D"expand-contr=
ol-icon icon">&nbsp;</span><span class=3D"expand-control-text">Expand sourc=
e</span></span><span class=3D"collapse-spinner-wrapper"></span>
       </div>
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl hide-toolbar">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: json; gutter: true; collapse: true">{
=09"resources": [{
=09=09"id": "",
=09=09"name": "",
=09=09"type": "",
=09=09"restriction": boolean,
=09=09"description": "",
=09=09"group": "",
=09=09"label": "",
=09=09"purpose": "",
=09=09"version": "",
=09=09"active": boolean
=09}]
}</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><br></p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.003</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>GET /entitlements/firms</p>
      <p><strong>GET /entitlements/firms/internals</strong></p>
      <p>GET /entitlements/firms/externals</p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">List of firms and their RR code ranges</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl hide-border-bottom" style=
=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
        <b class=3D"code-title">Response Payload</b><span class=3D"collapse=
-source expand-control" style=3D"display:none;"><span class=3D"expand-contr=
ol-icon icon">&nbsp;</span><span class=3D"expand-control-text">Expand sourc=
e</span></span><span class=3D"collapse-spinner-wrapper"></span>
       </div>
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl hide-toolbar">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: json; gutter: true; collapse: true">{
=09"firms": [{
=09=09"id": ""
=09=09"name": "",
=09=09"type": "",
=09=09"description": "",
=09=09"active": boolean,
=09=09"brokerCode": "",
=09=09"bNumber": "",
=09=09"dealerCode": ""
=09=09"rrCodes": {
=09=09=09"codes": [""],
=09=09=09"ranges": [{
=09=09=09=09"from": ""
=09=09=09=09"to": ""
=09=09=09}]
=09=09}
=09}]
}</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>These endpoints are subject to filtering given a token and list of =
scopes (e.g. internal, external)</p>
     <p>e.g. IIQ (w/ <em>internal</em> scope) will be limited to internal f=
irms listing, whether it calls the generic or specific endpoint.&nbsp;</p><=
/td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.004</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>GET /entitlements/rrcodes</p>
      <p><strong>GET /entitlements/rrcodes/internals</strong></p>
      <p>GET /entitlements/rrcodes/externals</p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">List of RR codes</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl hide-border-bottom" style=
=3D"border-bottom-width: 1px;">
        <b class=3D"code-title">Response Payload</b><span class=3D"collapse=
-source expand-control" style=3D"display:none;"><span class=3D"expand-contr=
ol-icon icon">&nbsp;</span><span class=3D"expand-control-text">Expand sourc=
e</span></span><span class=3D"collapse-spinner-wrapper"></span>
       </div>
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl hide-toolbar">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: json; gutter: true; collapse: true">{
&nbsp; &nbsp; "rrCodes": [""]
}</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>N.B.</strong> The discrete list of RR codes is not stored i=
n FUM/Compass X. RR Code master table exists in CDB (SZ), AS/400 and eventu=
ally FGDA. Therefore, FUM will only be providing hardcoded RR codes (e.g. C=
NTA) and it must not be treated as the source of truth.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.005</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>GET /entitlements/modules</p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">List of modules</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
